From 6645ecc44e5c92a810bbbf33f7920b84c1ba8d0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 4 May 2026 22:26:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: sitemap index + paginate past Supabase 1000 row limit
 (NW3)

- getAllKeywords() now paginates in 1000-row chunks (was silently capped at 1000)
- sitemap.ts uses generateSitemaps() for sitemap index with child sitemaps
- /sitemap/0.xml = static + categories + blog (~93 URLs)
- /sitemap/1.xml = keywords 1-5000
- /sitemap/2.xml = keywords 5001-8263+
- Auto-scales as keyword count grows
---
 app/sitemap.ts  | 128 ++++++++++++++++++++++--------------------------
 lib/supabase.ts |  28 ++++++++---
 2 files changed, 80 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/sitemap.ts b/app/sitemap.ts
index 26eb273..392f24f 100644
